  "description": "Baseball gave Ye-Seong everything, and then took it all away. Years after injuries ended his career, he suddenly finds himself back at age 18. This means another shot at becoming the pitcher he once dreamed of being, but starting over means more than just returning to the mound. Ye-Seong has already lived through one career filled with regret, but reconnecting with his estranged father, a legendary MLB pitcher, this opportunity may prove to be a second chance at more than just baseball. \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
